      "number": 3,
      "statement": "How do you measure the impact of source-level work, such as changing a story, a norm or an institution, when the effects are diffuse, shared and delayed?",
      "progress": "A measurement approach validated on at least one historical source-level change, recovering an effect that independent historians agree took place.",
